","type":"ticker","link":"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/ticker\/486560\/","title":{"rendered":"Last Minute: Bonaire ab 416\u20ac mit Corendon von Amsterdam (Handgep\u00e4ck)"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Corendon bringt euch kurzfristig noch mit Abflug im November ab nur 416\u20ac von Amsterdam nach Bonaire in der Karibik. Zu diesem Preis sind Personal Item (bis 3 Kg) sowie Handgep\u00e4ck (bis 10 Kg) inklusive. Ben\u00f6tigt ihr auch Aufgabegep\u00e4ck, werden mindestens 533\u20ac f\u00e4llig.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/go2.travel-dealz.de\/?type=flights&amp;from=AMS&amp;to=BON&amp;date_out=2026-11-17&amp;date_in=2026-12-15&amp;oneway=false&amp;cabinclass=Y&amp;direct=false&amp;adults=1&amp;children=0&amp;infants=0&amp;currency=EUR&amp;airlines=CD&amp;destination=trip.de\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\">Zum Deal<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p><aside class=\"affiliate-marker-disclosure\">* Was der Stern bedeutet: F\u00fcr Links, die mit einem Asterisk markiert sind, erhalten wir eine Provision, wenn \u00fcber den verlinkten Anbieter eine Buchung oder eine bestimmte Aktion zustande kommt. F\u00fcr Euch entstehen dadurch keine Mehrkosten. F\u00fcr das reine Setzen des Links erhalten wir kein Geld.<\/aside><\/p>","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Corendon bringt euch kurzfristig noch mit Abflug im November ab nur 416\u20ac von Amsterdam nach Bonaire in der Karibik. Zu diesem Preis sind Personal Item (bis 3 Kg) sowie Handgep\u00e4ck (bis 10 Kg) inklusive. Ben\u00f6tigt ihr auch Aufgabegep\u00e4ck, werden mindestens 533\u20ac f\u00e4llig.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":11,"featured_media":267023,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"trello_card_id":"","suspend_date":"2026-11-16 23:59:00","suspend_unkown":true,"post_push_at":[],"suspend_fare_check":"","footnotes":""},"categories":[1757],"tags":[],"airline":[39867],"cruiseline":[],"region":[19080],"destinations":[3155],"origins":[2961],"period":[19097],"visibility":[],"class_list":["post-486560","ticker","type-ticker","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-economy-class","airline-corendon-airlines","region-all","destinations-bonaire","origins-amsterdam-schiphol-ams","period-november"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ticker\/486560","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ticker"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ticker"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/11"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=486560"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ticker\/486560\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":486561,"href":"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ticker\/486560\/revisions\/486561"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=486560"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=486560"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=486560"},{"taxonomy":"airline","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/airline?post=486560"},{"taxonomy":"cruiseline","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/cruiseline?post=486560"},{"taxonomy":"region","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/region?post=486560"},{"taxonomy":"destinations","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/destinations?post=486560"},{"taxonomy":"origins","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/origins?post=486560"},{"taxonomy":"period","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/period?post=486560"},{"taxonomy":"visibility","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/visibility?post=486560"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":486531,"date":"2026-11-03T17:09:35","date_gmt":"2026-11-03T16:09:35","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/ticker\/486531\/"},"modified":"2026-11-03T17:09:37","modified_gmt":"2026-11-03T16:09:37","slug":"condor-plant-zwei-eigene-lounges-am-flughafen-frankfurt","status":"publish","type":"ticker","link":"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/ticker\/486531\/","title":{"rendered":"Condor plant zwei eigene Lounges am Flughafen Frankfurt"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Condor entwickelt sich gerade zunehmend von einem Ferienflieger zu einer Airline, die auch Gesch\u00e4ftsreisende ansprechen m\u00f6chte. Dazu sollen k\u00fcnftig auch eigene Lounges beitragen. Das hat Condor-Chef Peter Gerber gem\u00e4\u00df <a href=\"https:\/\/www.aerotelegraph.com\/airlines\/condor-plant-am-flughafen-frankfurt-zwei-eigene-lounges-im-terminal-3\/492mx3s\">AeroTelegraph<\/a> gegen\u00fcber der Belegschaft verk\u00fcndet.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Demnach sind zwei Lounges im neuen Terminal 3 geplant: eine im Schengen-Bereich und eine im Non-Schengen-Bereich. Die Er\u00f6ffnung wird aber noch einige Zeit dauern und f\u00fcr Ende 2027 erwartet. Noch sind die Planungen anscheinend nicht allzu konkret, man befinde sich noch in der Planungsphase.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Im April zieht Condor als eine der letzten Airlines vom Terminal 1 ins Terminal 3 um. Auch Qatar Airways baut dort gerade <a href=\"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/news\/qatar-lounges-frankfurt-t3\/\" data-type=\"news\" data-id=\"461186\">zwei neue Lounges<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-right wp-block-paragraph\">Quelle: <a href=\"https:\/\/www.aerotelegraph.com\/airlines\/condor-plant-am-flughafen-frankfurt-zwei-eigene-lounges-im-terminal-3\/492mx3s\">AeroTelegraph<\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Condor entwickelt sich gerade zunehmend von einem Ferienflieger zu einer Airline, die auch Gesch\u00e4ftsreisende ansprechen m\u00f6chte. Dazu sollen k\u00fcnftig auch eigene Lounges beitragen. Das hat Condor-Chef Peter Gerber gem\u00e4\u00df AeroTelegraph gegen\u00fcber der Belegschaft verk\u00fcndet. Demnach sind zwei Lounges im neuen Terminal 3 geplant: eine im Schengen-Bereich und eine im Non-Schengen-Bereich. Die Er\u00f6ffnung wird aber noch [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":407609,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"trello_card_id":"","suspend_date":"2026-12-08 23:59:00","suspend_unkown":false,"post_push_at":[],"suspend_fare_check":"","footnotes":""},"categories":[1],"tags":[340],"airline":[86],"cruiseline":[],"region":[19080],"destinations":[],"origins":[],"period":[],"visibility":[],"class_list":["post-486531","ticker","type-ticker","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-allgemein","tag-lounge","airline-condor","region-all"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ticker\/486531","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ticker"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ticker"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/5"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=486531"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ticker\/486531\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":486534,"href":"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ticker\/486531\/revisions\/486534"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/407609"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=486531"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=486531"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=486531"},{"taxonomy":"airline","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/airline?post=486531"},{"taxonomy":"cruiseline","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/cruiseline?post=486531"},{"taxonomy":"region","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/region?post=486531"},{"taxonomy":"destinations","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/destinations?post=486531"},{"taxonomy":"origins","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/origins?post=486531"},{"taxonomy":"period","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/period?post=486531"},{"taxonomy":"visibility","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/travel-dealz.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/visibility?post=486531"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}]